# Copy to `.env` (gitignored, `chmod 600`) and fill in. Never commit real keys.
# Used by testnet mode only (paper mode never reads a .env). Load it with
#   moonshot exchange check --env-file .env
#   moonshot live run --config examples/testnet.toml --env-file .env

# Binance spot TESTNET keys: create them at https://testnet.binance.vision/ (log in with GitHub).
# They only work on the testnet and trade fake money.
MOONSHOT_BINANCE_TESTNET_API_KEY=
MOONSHOT_BINANCE_TESTNET_API_SECRET=

# The API token of the daemon (dashboard and API); also fine to keep here for testnet runs.
# MOONSHOT_API_TOKEN=

# Binance MAINNET keys: not used yet. Reserved for the mainnet phase (P4), which does not exist
# in this build; leave them empty. They are deliberately named differently from the testnet keys.
# MOONSHOT_BINANCE_API_KEY=
# MOONSHOT_BINANCE_API_SECRET=
